@host = http://localhost:5225

### Environmental reading, float
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "ESP32-7F2A",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "Environmental",
  "valueKind": "Float",
  "value": 42.5
}

### Power reading, int
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "METER-01",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "PowerConsumption",
  "valueKind": "Int",
  "value": 900
}

### Actuator reading, bool
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "VALVE-03",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "Actuator",
  "valueKind": "Bool",
  "value": true
}

### Rejected, tagged Bool but carries a number
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "VALVE-03",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "Actuator",
  "valueKind": "Bool",
  "value": 42
}

### Rejected, a power meter cannot publish a bool
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "METER-01",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "PowerConsumption",
  "valueKind": "Bool",
  "value": true
}

### Rejected, blank node id
POST {{host}}/api/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-09-13T14:22:31Z",
  "category": "Environmental",
  "valueKind": "Float",
  "value": 42.5
}

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
